{"t": 1794107352.0160518, "kind": "call", "tool": "gitlab_create_merge_request_thread", "args": {"body": "Fixed the red `main` pipeline (pipeline #8812, job `test:contract` / #77104).\n\nRoot cause: `billing/invoice.py::invoice_number()` built the sequence part with a plain `str(seq)`, so the contract test `contract/test_invoice.py::test_invoice_number_format` got `INV-2026-42` instead of the ERP-required `INV-2026-000042` (FIN-77: sequence zero-padded to 6 digits).\n\nFix: format the sequence with `seq:06d` \u2014 `return f\"INV-{year}-{seq:06d}\"`.\n\nVerified locally: `invoice_number(2026, 42) == \"INV-2026-000042\"`; sequences longer than 6 digits are left unchanged. `test:contract` should now pass and the `main` pipeline should go green.", "merge_request_iid": "12", "project_id": "billing-legacy"}, "ok": true}
